01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
Bayona and written by Derek Connolly and Colin Trevorrow.

13
01:09:52,500 --> 01:09:58,500
The sequel to Jurassic World (2015), it is the second installment in the Jurassic
World film series and fifth overall of the Jurassic Park franchise.

14
01:15:15,000 --> 01:15:21,000
Chris Pratt, Bryce Dallas Howard, BD Wong, and Jeff Goldblum reprise their roles from previous
films in the series, with Toby Jones, Ted Levine, and Rafe Spall joining the cast.

15
01:20:37,500 --> 01:20:43,500
The story follows Owen Grady and Claire Dearing as they return to the fictional Central American island of Isla Nublar to rescue the remaining
dinosaurs from an impending volcanic eruption, only to discover a mercenary team's ulterior motives to bring them to the US mainland.

16
01:26:00,000 --> 01:26:06,000
Filming took place from February to July 2017 in
the United Kingdom and in Hawaii.

17
01:31:22,500 --> 01:31:28,500
With a production budget of up to $465 million, Fallen Kingdom
is the second-most expensive film ever made.

18
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:51,000
Fallen Kingdom premiered at the WiZink Center in Madrid on May 21, 2018, and was
theatrically released in the United States on June 22, by Universal Pictures.

19
01:42:07,500 --> 01:42:13,500
The film grossed over $1.3 billion worldwide, making it the third Jurassic film to pass the billion-dollar mark, and
was the third-highest-grossing film of 2018 and peaked as the 12th-highest-grossing film of all time.

20
01:47:30,000 --> 01:47:36,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, who generally praised the visuals,
cinematography, music and darker tone, while others criticized the screenplay.

21
01:52:52,500 --> 01:52:58,500
A sequel, titled Jurassic World Dominion, was released on June 10, 2022.

22
01:58:15,000 --> 01:58:21,000
The film explores themes of tyrannosaurus rex, volcano,
rescue mission, sequel, wild animal.

23
02:03:37,500 --> 02:03:43,500
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
